<section id="faq">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="faq-head rev">
      <div class="chip center">FAQ</div>
      <h2>Questions? We've Got Answers.</h2>
      <p>Straight talk. No jargon. If you still have questions, email us at hello@bizstack.ai</p>
    </div>

    <div class="wrap-narrow">
      <div class="faq-list">

        <div class="faq-item rev">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            What exactly do I get for $99/month?
            <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body">
            <div class="faq-body-inner">
              The Starter plan includes a professionally designed, 5-page mobile-responsive website, hosting, SSL, domain connection, a contact form that emails you in real-time, Google Analytics setup, and a basic CRM to manage up to 500 contacts. You get everything a small business needs to have a credible, functional online presence — without the $3,000–$5,000 upfront agency fee. We build it, we host it, we maintain it.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item rev">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            How fast can you really build a website?
            <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body">
            <div class="faq-body-inner">
              Seriously fast. After you complete your onboarding assessment (5 minutes), our team gets to work immediately. Most websites are fully built and live within 48 hours. Complex sites with custom features may take 3–5 business days. We've built a plumber's website, connected it to their CRM, and had automated follow-up sequences running — all in the same week. Speed is not a marketing claim. It's how we operate.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item rev">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            Do I need to be technical to use this?
            <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body">
            <div class="faq-body-inner">
              Not even a little bit. If you can send an email and describe your business, you can work with BizStack.ai. We handle every technical detail — hosting, domains, SSL certificates, DNS records, CRM configuration, automation workflows, AI chatbot training, and more. You tell us what you need, you approve the final product, and we handle everything under the hood. Our clients range from 24-year-old e-commerce owners to 65-year-old contractors who've never logged into a CRM in their lives. They all love it.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item rev">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            What if I want to cancel?
            <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body">
            <div class="faq-body-inner">
              Cancel anytime with no penalty, no fees, and zero guilt. Just email us or click cancel in your dashboard. We'll keep everything live until the end of your current billing period. You own your domain and your contacts — we export everything for you when you leave, neatly packaged. We'd rather earn your business month after month by being genuinely good at what we do than by trapping you in a contract.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item rev">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            Can I upgrade or downgrade my plan?
            <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body">
            <div class="faq-body-inner">
              Absolutely. You can change your plan at any time through your dashboard. Upgrades take effect immediately and we begin building your new features right away. Downgrades take effect at the start of your next billing cycle. We prorate everything so you're never double-paying. And if you're not sure which plan to upgrade to, just email your account manager — that's literally what they're there for.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item rev">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            Do you work with businesses outside of Texas?
            <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body">
            <div class="faq-body-inner">
              Yes — we're headquartered in Texas but we serve small businesses across all 50 states. The vast majority of our work is done remotely, so location is never a limitation. We've built websites and systems for businesses from California to Florida to New York. If you're outside the US, reach out and we'll let you know on a case-by-case basis. Send a message to hello@bizstack.ai and we'll get back to you within one business day.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="faq-item rev">
          <button class="faq-q" aria-expanded="false">
            What makes you different from Squarespace or Wix?
            <svg class="faq-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round"></path></svg>
          </button>
          <div class="faq-body">
            <div class="faq-body-inner">
              Squarespace and Wix are DIY tools — great if you have 40+ hours and enjoy learning software. BizStack.ai is a done-for-you service. We build it, host it, update it, and make it actually generate business for you. But the bigger difference? We don't just build websites. We connect your website to a real CRM, automated follow-up, AI tools, payment processing, and content marketing. Squarespace is a blank canvas. BizStack is a complete revenue engine. You're not buying software. You're buying a team that wants your business to grow.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div><!-- /.faq-list -->
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

